Z||000007||Racer 1||03-01-2001||01:44 AM||||Crutchfield makes a flush mount kit! I got mine free with my Kenwood KRC-PS655 excelon tape deck with 10 disc changer. Now I took out the back bracket piece and slid in the radio with a piece of stire-foam under the radio. Looks good. The radio mount that sticks out works but smashing cd's into your headunit isnt good.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=159982&a=1168563&p=42189251&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||10
